---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Returns & Refunds Policy — UK Peptides"
  description="UK Peptides returns and refunds policy. 14-day right of withdrawal for UK buyers under the Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013 and Consumer Rights Act 2015."
>
  <section style="background:var(--dark);padding:3rem 0 2.5rem;">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <h1 style="color:#fff;font-size:2rem;">Returns &amp; Refunds Policy</h1>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-top:0.5rem;">Last updated: 14 May 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--bg);">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <div class="prose">

        <div class="callout" style="background:rgba(59,159,212,0.07);border:1px solid rgba(59,159,212,0.25);border-radius:var(--radius);">
          <strong>Your statutory rights:</strong> If you are a buyer in the United Kingdom, you have rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 and the Consumer Contracts (Information, Cancellation and Additional Charges) Regulations 2013. Nothing in this policy affects those rights.
        </div>

        <h2>1. Right to Cancel (UK Buyers — 14-Day Cooling-Off Period)</h2>
        <p>Under the Consumer Contracts (Information, Cancellation and Additional Charges) Regulations 2013, you have the right to cancel your order within <strong>14 calendar days</strong> of the day you receive the goods, without giving any reason.</p>
        <p>To exercise your right to cancel, you must inform us of your decision by a clear statement (e.g. by email) before the 14-day period expires:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@uk-peptides.eu">contact@uk-peptides.eu</a></li>
          <li>Subject line: "Cancellation — Order [your order number]"</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Upon receipt of your cancellation notice, we will confirm by email.</p>

        <h2>2. Conditions for Return</h2>
        <p>To be eligible for a return under the 14-day right to cancel:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The vial must be <strong>unopened and sealed</strong> in its original packaging</li>
          <li>The goods must not have been used or reconstituted</li>
          <li>You must notify us within 14 days of receipt</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Exceptions:</strong> The right of withdrawal does not apply to goods that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Have been opened, used, or reconstituted (biological/research reagents — hygiene and safety grounds)</li>
          <li>Are perishable or may deteriorate rapidly</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Quality Guarantee — Defective or Non-Conforming Products</h2>
        <p>All products are supplied at &gt;99% analytical purity (HPLC). If a product does not meet this specification, we will provide a <strong>replacement or full refund</strong> upon evidence of the quality deficiency.</p>
        <p>Contact <a href="mailto:contact@uk-peptides.eu">contact@uk-peptides.eu</a> within <strong>14 days of receipt</strong> with your order number and evidence (e.g. your own test results or lab report).</p>
        <p>Damaged or missing goods must be reported within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> with photographic evidence.</p>

        <h2>4. Refund Process</h2>
        <p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund. Approved refunds are processed within <strong>14 calendar days</strong> using the same payment method used for the original purchase.</p>
        <p>You are responsible for the return shipping costs unless the goods are defective or incorrect.</p>

        <h2>5. Consumer Rights Act 2015 (UK Buyers)</h2>
        <p>Under the Consumer Rights Act 2015, goods must be of satisfactory quality, fit for purpose, and as described. If goods do not meet these standards, you may be entitled to a repair, replacement, or refund depending on the circumstances. Contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@uk-peptides.eu">contact@uk-peptides.eu</a> to discuss your options.</p>

        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>For all returns and refund queries:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@uk-peptides.eu">contact@uk-peptides.eu</a></li>
          <li>Response time: within 2 business days</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
